**Shared infrastructure**

Backend · Database · Authentication · AI · Payments · Maps · Notifications · Analytics

There will be four primary user roles:

| Role             | Main responsibility            |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Customer         | Purchase local products        |
| Grower/Seller    | Sell agricultural produce      |
| Delivery partner | Fulfil deliveries              |
| Admin            | Control and monitor operations |

A customer and grower can use the same main ZENVEGO application with role-based dashboards.

The delivery interface should be a separate application/interface, and the admin interface should be separately protected.

