# **11. Maps, GPS and real-time tracking**

This functionality must work across all three applications.

### **Customer application**

- Display customer delivery address.
- Show delivery partner location during an active delivery.
- Show estimated arrival.
- Show pickup and destination information.
- Display delivery partner contact option.

### **Delivery application**

- Display grower pickup location.
- Display customer destination.
- Show navigation.
- Share location during active deliveries.
- Update delivery progress.

### **Admin application**

- View active orders.
- View delivery partner assignment.
- Monitor permitted live locations.
- Identify delayed deliveries.
- Review completed delivery records.

### **Technical location workflow**

```
Delivery partner grants location permission
             ↓
Delivery app receives GPS coordinates
             ↓
Backend validates delivery assignment
             ↓
Location update stored
             ↓
Real-time event published
             ↓
Customer dashboard receives update
             ↓
Admin dashboard receives update
```

Location security requirements:

- Location collection only during an active delivery.
- Permission-based tracking.
- Authenticated location updates.
- Rate-limited location requests.
- No public location access.
- Stop tracking after completion.
- Avoid unnecessarily retaining historical GPS data.

For the initial implementation, Leaflet with an appropriate OpenStreetMap-compatible tile provider can provide the map interface. Do not assume that public map servers provide unlimited commercial usage.

# **12. Database design — complete data structure**

The database must represent the entire marketplace, not just users and products.

Recommended Firestore collections:

| Collection        | Purpose                             |
| ----------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| users             | Customer and account information    |
| growerProfiles    | Seller profiles                     |
| deliveryProfiles  | Delivery partner profiles           |
| adminProfiles     | Administrative permissions          |
| products          | Marketplace products                |
| categories        | Product categories                  |
| inventory         | Stock records                       |
| carts             | Customer shopping carts             |
| orders            | Main order records                  |
| orderItems        | Individual ordered products         |
| payments          | Payment transactions                |
| refunds           | Refund transactions                 |
| assignments       | Delivery assignments                |
| deliveryLocations | Latest active location              |
| deliveryEvents    | Delivery history                    |
| reviews           | Customer feedback                   |
| notifications     | User notifications                  |
| addresses         | Saved delivery addresses            |
| commissions       | Platform commission records         |
| settlements       | Seller and delivery payouts         |
| supportTickets    | Customer and seller complaints      |
| certifications    | Verification evidence               |
| aiInteractions    | AI interaction metadata             |
| auditLogs         | Important system activities         |
| serviceAreas      | Delivery availability configuration |
| platformSettings  | Operational configuration           |

